!!!the periodic table of the elements

=     H                                                     He
=     Li Be                                  B  C  N  O  F  Ne
=     Na Mg                                  Al Si P  S  Cl Ar
=     K  Ca    Sc Ti V  Cr Mn Fe Co Ni Cu Zn Ga Ge As Se Br Kr
=     Rb Sr    Y  Zr Nb Mo Tc Ru Rh Pd Ag Cd In Sn Sb Te I  Xe
=     Cs Ba *A Lu Hf Ta W  Re Os Ir Pt Au Hg Tl Pb Bi Po At Rn
=     Fr Ra *B Lr Rf Db Sg Bh Hs Mt Ds 
=
=     *A: La Ce Pr Nd Pm Sm Eu Gd Tb Dy Ho Er Tm Yb
=     *B: Ac Th Pa U  Np Pu Am Cm Bk Cf Es Fm Md No

!!!groups

The regular place structure is "x1 is a quantity of/contains/is made of a substance of foo group of specific type x2".

*{jvsn alkali metal general=1} (default sodium): {jvsv sodna}
*{jvsn halogen general=1} (default chlorine): {jvsv kliru}
*{jvsn noble gas general=1} (default neon): {jvsv navni}

!!!elements

The regular place structure is "x1 is a quantity of/contains/is made of foo element".  There are no exceptions.

